How to remember studied ds&algo?
Key strategies:
Revision:
Revise regularly whenever time permits & also saturdays & sundays coz., only then you will remember to use it and also for interviews
Practice coding:
Solve problems on platforms like LeetCode, HackerRank, or Codeforces to actively implement algorithms and data structures in code, which strengthens your understanding and memory retention. 
Visualize the process:
Draw diagrams or use visual aids to understand how data is manipulated within each data structure and how algorithms progress through different steps. 
Break it down:
Divide complex algorithms into smaller, manageable sub-steps to grasp the logic behind each part more easily. 
Understand the use case:
For each data structure and algorithm, clearly identify the type of problem it is best suited to solve, which helps with choosing the right tool for a given situation. 
Relate to real-world examples:
Find analogies or real-life situations that mirror the behavior of a data structure or algorithm to aid memory. 
Use flashcards:
Create flashcards with the data structure or algorithm name on one side and its key points or pseudocode on the other for quick review. 
Teach others:
Explaining a concept to someone else forces you to articulate your understanding clearly, which can solidify your knowledge. 
Group similar concepts:
Identify patterns and similarities between different algorithms to make learning more efficient. 
Mnemonic devices:
Create memory aids like acronyms or short phrases to remember key steps or properties of an algorithm. 


